  (text
    "GPIO10 / interboard pin10 becomes TIP_EXC_EN (not accelerometer interrupt).\nPulse high only for settled ADC conversions; force low on error and sleep.\nR_NTC = 10k * AIN0 / (2*AIN1 - AIN0). PGA +/-4.096 V; 128 SPS single shot.\nExternal fixed sensor daughterboard carries both accel and magnetometer; no body-mounted MC3635."
    (at 40.64 165.1 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left top))
    (uuid e43721cd-101b-5169-ab44-60c8f95ab734))
